{
    "title": "Victoria's Secret\u2014Bras & More",
    "description": "Welcome to the Victoria\u2019s Secret App: Your go-to destination for discovering new trends, exclusive offers, the latest and greatest shopping and styling content, & so much more. We have it all\u2014from super-comfy, stay-in basics to glam going-out looks, we\u2019ve got you (and every occasion you\u2019re dressing for) fully covered. Thanks to Bras, Panties, Lingerie, Sleep, Sport, and Swim (not to mention Beauty and Accessories) in sizes XS-XXL, cups AA-O, and bands 28-46, there\u2019s  something for everyone. And that\u2019s just the beginning\u2014here are some other great things we have going on: \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSMOOTH CHECKOUT\r\n\r\nSave your payment method for streamlined transactions, instantly manage your bills, and more (also, personalize your profile for future reference). \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCUTTING-EDGE TOOLS\r\n\r\nSuch as Verifyt by Netvirta\u2014a new 3D-scanning technology that helps you find your best Bra fit from the comfort of anywhere in just a few clicks.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nJUST-FOR-YOU CONTENT \r\n\r\nTake fun quizzes, snag special offers, view behind-the-scenes campaign videos, and other for-your-eyes-only exclusives. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nMEMBERS-ONLY PERKS\r\n\r\nJoin VS & PINK Rewards to earn points with every purchase, which turn into perks like Free Shipping and top-tier deals. Plus, you\u2019ll get access to the Community\u2014a space to create, connect, and get inspired.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLike what you see? There\u2019s more to explore. Follow along on social at @victoriassecret. We can\u2019t wait to connect with you.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the Victoria\u2019s Secret App: Your go-to destination for discovering new trends, exclusive offers, the latest and greatest shopping and styling content, &amp; so much more. We have it all\u2014from super-comfy, stay-in basics to glam going-out looks, we\u2019ve got you (and every occasion you\u2019re dressing for) fully covered. Thanks to Bras, Panties, Lingerie, Sleep, Sport, and Swim (not to mention Beauty and Accessories) in sizes XS-XXL, cups AA-O, and bands 28-46, there\u2019s  something for everyone. And that\u2019s just the beginning\u2014here are some other great things we have going on: <br><br><br><br>SMOOTH CHECKOUT<br><br>Save your payment method for streamlined transactions, instantly manage your bills, and more (also, personalize your profile for future reference). <br><br><br><br>CUTTING-EDGE TOOLS<br><br>Such as Verifyt by Netvirta\u2014a new 3D-scanning technology that helps you find your best Bra fit from the comfort of anywhere in just a few clicks.<br><br><br><br>JUST-FOR-YOU CONTENT <br><br>Take fun quizzes, snag special offers, view behind-the-scenes campaign videos, and other for-your-eyes-only exclusives. <br><br><br><br>MEMBERS-ONLY PERKS<br><br>Join VS &amp; PINK Rewards to earn points with every purchase, which turn into perks like Free Shipping and top-tier deals. Plus, you\u2019ll get access to the Community\u2014a space to create, connect, and get inspired.<br><br><br><br>Like what you see? There\u2019s more to explore. Follow along on social at @victoriassecret. We can\u2019t wait to connect with you.",
